[{:db/id "q-109552/selection/8a336dc27360b856b317029a9364933515d19cb32d15d3c56bfe0ada9a7be3a1" :answer/id #uuid "728b45bd-ec6c-5c44-b600-a7f0813bb9a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,{x}_{1}-6t{x}_{2}-9{x}_{3}+t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109552/selection/89b345d69f32ea82fe2f9b82d9f8df7569d9e409bd531d6ecb7f8627224f5bf1" :answer/id #uuid "2efc4051-8615-56f4-9dd4-459d199339bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,{x}_{1}+6t{x}_{2}+9{x}_{3}-t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109552/selection/db6941ef38bdc5b3c2acd36d2ba7d0f9e7280aac32860622381269b1951a71de" :answer/id #uuid "53508aef-8e7e-56da-b01c-e1cbbda69a97" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-9{x}_{1}-6t{x}_{2}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,{x}_{3}-t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109552/selection/0086fd55a42fedcbd6b0b5183edd01ea2f4dfbe46440e6125bee1e8f73175aae" :answer/id #uuid "3222640d-b8d0-55f9-bb1d-5014ca0c762b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9{x}_{1}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,{x}_{2}+6t{x}_{3}+t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109552/selection/e083a8a1d50db68a3f92fb2ffc266e1faaf7821c5f7d487ccf633070c6c2acbb" :answer/id #uuid "6f1b7e0c-cb7f-5ef7-a5b9-df21cf5d787f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9{x}_{1}+6t{x}_{2}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,{x}_{3}+t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109552/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c66720c1-106d-5f08-81ee-2b6e172ca5da" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-109552/selection/e083a8a1d50db68a3f92fb2ffc266e1faaf7821c5f7d487ccf633070c6c2acbb" :answer-field/choices ["q-109552/selection/8a336dc27360b856b317029a9364933515d19cb32d15d3c56bfe0ada9a7be3a1" "q-109552/selection/89b345d69f32ea82fe2f9b82d9f8df7569d9e409bd531d6ecb7f8627224f5bf1" "q-109552/selection/db6941ef38bdc5b3c2acd36d2ba7d0f9e7280aac32860622381269b1951a71de" "q-109552/selection/0086fd55a42fedcbd6b0b5183edd01ea2f4dfbe46440e6125bee1e8f73175aae" "q-109552/selection/e083a8a1d50db68a3f92fb2ffc266e1faaf7821c5f7d487ccf633070c6c2acbb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-109552" :question/id #uuid "de8bfde6-0de1-55c1-b649-65cf4f0baf96" :question/math-academy-id "q-109552" :question/problem "The third-order differential equation \n\n$$\n{y}^{‴}-\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,{y}^{″}-6t{y}^{′}-9y=t\n$$\n\ncan be written as a system of first-order differential equations, as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}=f(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${x}_{1}(t)=y(t),$ ${x}_{2}(t)={y}^{′}(t)$ and ${x}_{3}(t)={y}^{″}(t).$ Find the function $f(t).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we make the following change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) & =y \\\\ {x}_{2}(t) & ={y}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{3}(t) & ={y}^{″}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the above equations with respect to $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{″} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{‴}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we can rewrite as \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2}, \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3}, \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}={y}^{‴}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt this point, we're almost done. We just need to write the right-hand side of the last equation in terms of ${x}_{1},$ ${x}_{2},$ and ${x}_{3}.$\n\nSolving our original differential equation for the highest-order derivative $({y}^{‴}),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n{y}^{‴}=\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,{y}^{″}+6t{y}^{′}+9y+t.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute our new variables into the right-hand side of the above equation. This gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{‴}=\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,{x}_{3}+6t{x}_{2}+9{x}_{1}+t.\n$$\n\nNotice that we do not include any derivative terms on the right-hand side. \n\nTherefore, our complete system of equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2}, \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3}, \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}=9{x}_{1}+6t{x}_{2}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,{x}_{3}+t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\nf(t)=9{x}_{1}+6t{x}_{2}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,{x}_{3}+t.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-109552/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d600416b-05f5-593f-a2ad-bb3a08d60b45"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109552"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-107932"] :question/problem "The third-order differential equation \n\n$$\n{y}^{‴}-\\sqrt{t}\\,{y}^{″}-y={t}^{2}\n$$\n\ncan be written as a system of first-order differential equations, as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}=f(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${x}_{1}(t)=y(t),$ ${x}_{2}(t)={y}^{′}(t)$ and ${x}_{3}(t)={y}^{″}(t).$ Find the function $f(t).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we make the following change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) & =y \\\\ {x}_{2}(t) & ={y}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{3}(t) & ={y}^{″}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the above equations with respect to $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{″} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{‴}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we can rewrite as \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2}, \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3}, \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}={y}^{‴}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt this point, we're almost done. We just need to write the right-hand side of the last equation in terms of ${x}_{1},$ ${x}_{2},$ and ${x}_{3}.$\n\nSolving our original differential equation for the highest-order derivative $({y}^{‴}),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n{y}^{‴}=\\sqrt{t}\\,{y}^{″}+y+{t}^{2}.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute our new variables into the right-hand side of the above equation. This gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{‴}=\\sqrt{t}\\,{x}_{3}+{x}_{1}+{t}^{2}.\n$$\n\nNotice that we do not include any derivative terms on the right-hand side. \n\nTherefore, our complete system of equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2}, \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3}, \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}={x}_{1}+\\sqrt{t}\\,{x}_{3}+{t}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\nf(t)={x}_{1}+\\sqrt{t}\\,{x}_{3}+{t}^{2}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-109538/selection/87bedcde26d0306d29690d3604b3b8174bb505d13dc54a2a49605dc8f8512e0c" :answer/id #uuid "2e5a835a-6dfc-575c-a0cf-1f74da36c392" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{t}^{2}{x}_{1}+3t{x}_{2}+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109538/selection/be856837d8526458b14447d7cb8d7bf77122014503cda8dc5b16bbdac20421ae" :answer/id #uuid "d39b962f-b144-5e14-82e7-e80c6ffbbfab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{t}^{2}{x}_{1}-3t{x}_{2}-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109538/selection/c2e600ca83c5eb11ae73f31b8f3c8bb1c0b84d8d866b9a7f9b2d950870b846c4" :answer/id #uuid "f37b47ab-be49-53c4-b2a9-322c22491ddd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3t{x}_{1}+{t}^{2}{x}_{2}+6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109538/selection/74b0019d38e1dc5cb7466480c44ad9c013e20885176e9e31c5d292360b282360" :answer/id #uuid "9e90cb3c-7e3a-5c7d-9fe0-a113d3a1fa71" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{t}^{2}{x}_{1}-3t{x}_{2}-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109538/selection/64ca483d848fc3bcf105d621649fc74717a5ca4ed9e930f5efc9c0551e72a53b" :answer/id #uuid "6f6cd687-7442-58ed-8ae0-6bab4649fb6c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3t{x}_{1}-{t}^{2}{x}_{2}-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109538/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4f37352a-9a04-535f-bb88-a6601ffedb84" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-109538/selection/87bedcde26d0306d29690d3604b3b8174bb505d13dc54a2a49605dc8f8512e0c" :answer-field/choices ["q-109538/selection/87bedcde26d0306d29690d3604b3b8174bb505d13dc54a2a49605dc8f8512e0c" "q-109538/selection/be856837d8526458b14447d7cb8d7bf77122014503cda8dc5b16bbdac20421ae" "q-109538/selection/c2e600ca83c5eb11ae73f31b8f3c8bb1c0b84d8d866b9a7f9b2d950870b846c4" "q-109538/selection/74b0019d38e1dc5cb7466480c44ad9c013e20885176e9e31c5d292360b282360" "q-109538/selection/64ca483d848fc3bcf105d621649fc74717a5ca4ed9e930f5efc9c0551e72a53b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-109538" :question/id #uuid "0b8dd8ee-7cc2-5fd2-bcd2-b8827398104f" :question/math-academy-id "q-109538" :question/problem "The second-order differential equation \n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-3t{y}^{′}+{t}^{2}y=6\n$$\n\ncan be written as a system of first-order differential equations, as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}=f(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${x}_{1}(t)=y(t)$ and ${x}_{2}(t)={y}^{′}(t).$ Find the function $f(t).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we make the following change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) & =y \\\\ {x}_{2}(t) & ={y}^{′}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the above equations with respect to $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{″}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we can rewrite as \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2}, \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={y}^{″}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt this point, we're almost done. We just need to write the right-hand side of the last equation in terms of ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2}.$\n\nSolving our original differential equation for the highest-order derivative $({y}^{″}),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}=3t{y}^{′}-{t}^{2}y+6.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute our new variables into the right-hand side of the above equation. This gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}=3t{x}_{2}-{t}^{2}{x}_{1}+6.\n$$\n\nNotice that we do not include any derivative terms on the right-hand side. \n\nTherefore, our complete system of equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}=-{t}^{2}{x}_{1}+3t{x}_{2}+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\nf(t)=-{t}^{2}{x}_{1}+3t{x}_{2}+6.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-109538/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d600416b-05f5-593f-a2ad-bb3a08d60b45"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109538"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-109534/selection/cae317b235c1f4e5fadc281210f3e270cbec8ffd917c21f335bdb94cdec8ae44" :answer/id #uuid "a2375be9-a6fb-59e6-818f-153a51a58ec5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{t}^{2}{x}_{2}+t+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109534/selection/0e6fabaa735a0b24b3ba86b2f25658bb54f890b969133a394a9aaf3ca5bb2840" :answer/id #uuid "d3d82c67-3abf-50e3-912b-fcefb565e698" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "t{x}_{1}+{t}^{2}{x}_{2}+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109534/selection/f74667eda17b9ab68f7cb0e5c84fac9a3b25e9fc367bd21a7fdadf96237e3060" :answer/id #uuid "47d798b8-9ab9-5692-a4aa-24cf1cea6eed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-t{x}_{1}+{t}^{2}{x}_{2}+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109534/selection/0b16d479226a1eb4e6c955e5b77424a1e287f8e991c40211ae995b4279449bbd" :answer/id #uuid "0d796322-0c5f-5c6e-bfdb-4e26209cf6e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{t}^{2}{x}_{1}+t+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109534/selection/990666dee91970e5a1c059e6b42963a8e162b574aea4ee34af1b5d8bb1b03519" :answer/id #uuid "c5fa888b-ed5e-5ac7-be9c-2d0bce87ac3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{t}^{2}{x}_{2}-{x}_{2}+t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109534/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1a9c34b3-4337-5630-a530-d5430581a4fc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-109534/selection/cae317b235c1f4e5fadc281210f3e270cbec8ffd917c21f335bdb94cdec8ae44" :answer-field/choices ["q-109534/selection/cae317b235c1f4e5fadc281210f3e270cbec8ffd917c21f335bdb94cdec8ae44" "q-109534/selection/0e6fabaa735a0b24b3ba86b2f25658bb54f890b969133a394a9aaf3ca5bb2840" "q-109534/selection/f74667eda17b9ab68f7cb0e5c84fac9a3b25e9fc367bd21a7fdadf96237e3060" "q-109534/selection/0b16d479226a1eb4e6c955e5b77424a1e287f8e991c40211ae995b4279449bbd" "q-109534/selection/990666dee91970e5a1c059e6b42963a8e162b574aea4ee34af1b5d8bb1b03519"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-109534" :question/id #uuid "e5a32215-b5b1-50a0-91d4-9a509b256a6f" :question/math-academy-id "q-109534" :question/problem "The second-order differential equation \n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-{t}^{2}{y}^{′}=t+1\n$$\n\ncan be written as a system of first-order differential equations, as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}=f(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${x}_{1}(t)=y(t)$ and ${x}_{2}(t)={y}^{′}(t).$ Find the function $f(t).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we make the following change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) & =y \\\\ {x}_{2}(t) & ={y}^{′}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the above equations with respect to $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{″}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we can rewrite as \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2}, \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={y}^{″}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt this point, we're almost done. We just need to write the right-hand side of the last equation in terms of ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2}.$\n\nSolving our original differential equation for the highest-order derivative $({y}^{″}),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}={t}^{2}{y}^{′}+t+1.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute our new variables into the right-hand side of the above equation. This gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}={t}^{2}{x}_{2}+t+1.\n$$\n\nNotice that we do not include any derivative terms on the right-hand side. \n\nTherefore, our complete system of equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={t}^{2}{x}_{2}+t+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\nf(t)={t}^{2}{x}_{2}+t+1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-109534/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d600416b-05f5-593f-a2ad-bb3a08d60b45"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109534"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-109547/selection/6fb51ea21bb70ea140d17fad1b3fda6a6e71ba3d0950bcde9c49f2251968fe21" :answer/id #uuid "20fbfff6-bec8-5f88-8ce0-3a78cf21c8a5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}-{x}_{3}-2t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109547/selection/48694b7c76a5a66d50207c3610a650815e43b662abaddb27a45e069c5150d0ea" :answer/id #uuid "64fdadbb-e982-5479-9580-2c57c819459b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{1}-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{x}_{3}+2t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109547/selection/92a12e98d8a6bd7bf64c40abb0924f6e07a2fbb0e780e8b8cdb1037e1deb7933" :answer/id #uuid "d98f4250-d9bc-5a16-b6a0-acf0886a28aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,{x}_{3}+2t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109547/selection/8e951f3744a272b2a118347eafe5da66e8d060984463cfc9e6738e0b721ae517" :answer/id #uuid "77f21c97-4c5f-5c08-9e5e-ea41420abf9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}+2t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109547/selection/984a4c64dd8a62da3bdc18646d4eac68487d7e6cf90adb3ae9c3bed5f6e496f0" :answer/id #uuid "c2650ba0-4101-56c3-a14c-8930e8f1667c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,{x}_{3}-2t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-109547/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "67a7166f-b533-57c3-b077-ceac06c62f6a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-109547/selection/8e951f3744a272b2a118347eafe5da66e8d060984463cfc9e6738e0b721ae517" :answer-field/choices ["q-109547/selection/6fb51ea21bb70ea140d17fad1b3fda6a6e71ba3d0950bcde9c49f2251968fe21" "q-109547/selection/48694b7c76a5a66d50207c3610a650815e43b662abaddb27a45e069c5150d0ea" "q-109547/selection/92a12e98d8a6bd7bf64c40abb0924f6e07a2fbb0e780e8b8cdb1037e1deb7933" "q-109547/selection/8e951f3744a272b2a118347eafe5da66e8d060984463cfc9e6738e0b721ae517" "q-109547/selection/984a4c64dd8a62da3bdc18646d4eac68487d7e6cf90adb3ae9c3bed5f6e496f0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-109547" :question/id #uuid "511f3a0a-b968-54ba-a869-530d4a63e749" :question/math-academy-id "q-109547" :question/problem "The third-order differential equation \n\n$$\n{y}^{‴}-{y}^{″}+3{y}^{′}-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,y=2t\n$$\n\ncan be written as a system of first-order differential equations, as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}=f(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${x}_{1}(t)=y(t),$ ${x}_{2}(t)={y}^{′}(t)$ and ${x}_{3}(t)={y}^{″}(t).$ Find the function $f(t).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we make the following change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) & =y \\\\ {x}_{2}(t) & ={y}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{3}(t) & ={y}^{″}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the above equations with respect to $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{″} \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}(t) & ={y}^{‴}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we can rewrite as \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2}, \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3}, \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}={y}^{‴}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAt this point, we're almost done. We just need to write the right-hand side of the last equation in terms of ${x}_{1},$ ${x}_{2},$ and ${x}_{3}.$\n\nSolving our original differential equation for the highest-order derivative $({y}^{‴}),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n{y}^{‴}={y}^{″}-3{y}^{′}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,y+2t.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute our new variables into the right-hand side of the above equation. This gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{‴}={x}_{3}-3{x}_{2}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,{x}_{1}+2t.\n$$\n\nNotice that we do not include any derivative terms on the right-hand side. \n\nTherefore, our complete system of equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2}, \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={x}_{3}, \\\\ {x}_{3}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}+2t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\nf(t)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}+2t.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-109547/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d600416b-05f5-593f-a2ad-bb3a08d60b45"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109547"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "27138069-06a0-50c5-8fd2-66c2ec8d67ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "eaf02814-f6cf-55d7-9ee9-f92c9784572c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-330754/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-330754/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-2/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "46d49d23-c188-5322-9704-7e99de35ea4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "2875a721-71b7-5832-955a-94420995f7d7" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-330754/field-2/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-330754/field-2/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "263e8d38-3342-5e02-91ed-a3b8b88678d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "8863999e-a8d2-59e2-bb0d-4be3280b5b85" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-330754/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-330754/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-4/ceb90ea900b5c22a8857c0503c8a390d02978ebe055044dc6e5aef366e53c53b" :answer/id #uuid "5a179747-dcb3-52d0-8e75-939ad2fdf6be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-t^2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "c1b75357-c8d5-5bad-94ee-f6190e32c085" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-330754/field-4/ceb90ea900b5c22a8857c0503c8a390d02978ebe055044dc6e5aef366e53c53b" :answer-field/choices ["q-330754/field-4/ceb90ea900b5c22a8857c0503c8a390d02978ebe055044dc6e5aef366e53c53b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-5/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "49b0c942-f5a2-5519-8c8c-66af20cb1bbb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-5" :answer-field/id #uuid "65ef50ad-4ff2-525f-a67f-4fa210f8172f" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-330754/field-5/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer-field/choices ["q-330754/field-5/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-6/ca1d32f203774a8ef86bad6621df316ec7e26c3f1bee09c8fda644049a2582e4" :answer/id #uuid "913373ba-7f70-5e30-babc-fa827f48a2d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "te^t" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754/field-6" :answer-field/id #uuid "52b66dab-d461-5df4-89cd-39f97433f2af" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-330754/field-6/ca1d32f203774a8ef86bad6621df316ec7e26c3f1bee09c8fda644049a2582e4" :answer-field/choices ["q-330754/field-6/ca1d32f203774a8ef86bad6621df316ec7e26c3f1bee09c8fda644049a2582e4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-330754" :question/id #uuid "bcbff8cd-0cd6-5bb6-a555-e0f1e27e7f2f" :question/math-academy-id "q-330754" :question/problem "The second-order differential equation ${y}^{″}-5{y}^{′}+{t}^{2}y=t{e}^{t}$ can be expressed as the matrix equation ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)+f(t),$ where\n\n| $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}],\\,A=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  | $\\,,\\,f(t)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-3}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-4}} | {{field-5}} |  |  | {{field-6}} |  |  |  |\n\nand for $y=y(t),$ we have $y={x}_{1}(t)$ and ${y}^{′}={x}_{2}(t).$" :question/worked-solution "We first need to express the given differential equation as a system of first-order differential equations. Then, we write the system as a matrix equation.\n\nWe start by making the following change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =y \\\\ {x}_{2} & ={y}^{′}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the above equations with respect to $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={y}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={y}^{″}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we can rewrite as\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2}, \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}={y}^{″}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe must now write the right-hand side of the last equation in terms of ${x}_{1}$ and ${x}_{2}.$\n\nSolving our original differential equation for the highest-order derivative $({y}^{″}),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}=5{y}^{′}-{t}^{2}y+t{e}^{t}.\n$$\n\nThen, we substitute our new variables into the right-hand side of the above equation. This gives\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}=5{x}_{2}-{t}^{2}{x}_{1}+t{e}^{t}.\n$$\n\nNotice that we do not include any derivative terms on the right-hand side. \n\nTherefore, our complete system of equations is as follows:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}={x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}=-{t}^{2}{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}+t{e}^{t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can represent this system as the matrix differential equation ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)+f(t)$ as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′} \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -{t}^{2} & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ t{e}^{t}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-330754/field-1" "q-330754/field-2" "q-330754/field-3" "q-330754/field-4" "q-330754/field-5" "q-330754/field-6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9a7f2a0b-777f-5d63-9f3a-3b3f4a6969d8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-330754"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-330792/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "8899737f-1a2b-54dd-901b-e10b80abcd56" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330792/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "b6f11e82-391f-5219-a855-ab975d662aee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330792/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "1b090c15-2670-5178-b98f-5259d8d6959e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-330792/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-330792/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-330792/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-330792/field-2/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "dca06435-52cb